4MTUz","user":{"login":"AD7six","id":33387,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMzg3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33387?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AD7six","html_url":"https://github.com/AD7six","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AD7six/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AD7six/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AD7six/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AD7six/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AD7six/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AD7six/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AD7six/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AD7six/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AD7six/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2014-12-29T17:31:36Z","updated_at":"2014-12-29T17:31:36Z","body":"Well, that's not going to work =).\n\nWhen an exception is thrown, it doesn't matter what controller is in use - the [CakeErrorController](https://github.com/cakephp/cakephp/blob/master/lib/Cake/Error/ExceptionRenderer.php#L154) class is used to render the error, which [extends the AppController](https://github.com/cakephp/cakephp/blob/master/lib/Cake/Controller/CakeErrorController.php#L30).\n\nGiven that, it's expected that config that is local to an individual controller takes no effect, whereas config in the `AppController` does. \n\nIf you want the requestHandler component to be configured on a per-controller basis, you can do that (sort of) but it needs to be with code that is executed when the `CakeErrorController` is instanciated.\n\nClosing as that's expected behavior and not likely to change.\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cakephp/cakephp/issues/comments/68278153/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confuse